Kernel 7 passes the key and station callbacks and cfg80211_new_sta/del_sta the
wireless_dev instead of its net_device, adds the rx address to remain_on_channel
and moves the action code of an action frame up next to the category. It also
dropped in_irq() and strncpy(). The strncpy() calls in rwnx_platform.c copy
substrings that hold no NUL, so memcpy() does the same. The firmware error
string was not NUL terminated when the message filled it.
---
